<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS - Bid to halt Ernest Henry power refused.</title>
<headline>RTRS - Bid to halt Ernest Henry power refused.</headline>
<dateline>BRISBANE 1996-10-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Queensland Federal Court on Friday refused to an application by an aboriginal group for an injunction to halt a key power line link to MIM Holdings Ltd's Ernest Henry copper and gold project in Queensland.</p>
</text>
